  "label": "False Accusation Narrative",
  "description": "The meme constructs a false narrative that implies Barack Obama is being falsely accused or blamed for something, while Hillary Clinton is attempting to deflect blame by invoking his racial identity. This is a form of misinformation that attempts to undermine Obama’s credibility by tying his actions to his race, which is a form of racial stereotyping and hate. The narrative is false because it misrepresents the actual context of the political discourse.",
